sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Train/Orchestrator
    participant E as SnakeEngine
    participant S as StateBuilder
    participant A as DQNAgent

    T->>E: step(action)
    E->>E: update_physics()
    E->>T: raw_game_data
    T->>S: build_state(raw_data)
    S->>T: feature_vector
    T->>A: store_and_train(state, reward)
    A->>A: optimize_model()
    A->>T: next_action